{"name":"Yellowstone","hex":"#ceb736","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Yellowstone","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A national park of the USA, located in Montana, Idaho and Wyoming.","A river that rises in the park before flowing through Wyoming, Montana and North Dakota, where it empties into the Missouri River."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Yellowstone"}],"entries":[{"title":"Yellowstone (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Yellowstone is an American neo-Western drama television series created by Taylor Sheridan and John Linson for Paramount Network. The series premiered on June 20, 2018, and concluded on December 15, 2024, after five seasons comprising 53 episodes. It stars Kevin Costner, Luke Grimes, Kelly Reilly, Wes Bentley, Cole Hauser, Kelsey Asbille, and Gil Birmingham. The series follows the conflicts surrounding the Yellowstone Dutton Ranch along the borders of the neighboring Broken Rock Indian reservation, Yellowstone National Park, and land development interests, while also focusing on the Dutton family's internal conflicts."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yellowstone_(TV_series)"},{"title":"Yellowstone (franchise)","blocks":[{"text":"Yellowstone, sometimes called the Duttonverse or spelled alternatively as the Dutton-verse, is an American media franchise created by Taylor Sheridan and John Linson, and owned by Paramount Skydance. It follows the Dutton family over the years, owners of the largest cattle ranch in Montana, the Yellowstone Dutton Ranch, and centers around the family drama at the ranch and the bordering Broken Rock Indian Reservation, Yellowstone National Park, and land developers."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yellowstone_(franchise)"},{"title":"Yellowstone National Park","blocks":[{"text":"Yellowstone National Park is a national park of the United States located mainly in the northwest corner of the state of Wyoming, with small portions extending into Montana and Idaho. The park is known for its wildlife and its many geothermal features, especially the Old Faithful geyser, one of its most popular. While it represents many types of biomes, subalpine forest is the most abundant. It is part of the South Central Rockies forests ecoregion."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/60/Grand_Canyon_of_the_Yellowstone_Lower_Falls_%2895819p%29.jpg/330px-Grand_Canyon_of_the_Yellowstone_Lower_Falls_%2895819p%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yellowstone_National_Park"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Chief_Joseph_Ranch.jpg/500px-Chief_Joseph_Ranch.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Chief_Joseph_Ranch.jpg/500px-Chief_Joseph_Ranch.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Chief Joseph Ranch near Darby, Montana.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChief_Joseph_Ranch.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Obsidian_cliff_cleavage.jpg/500px-Obsidian_cliff_cleavage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Obsidian_cliff_cleavage.jpg/500px-Obsidian_cliff_cleavage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Exposed rock at Obsidian Cliff","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AObsidian_cliff_cleavage.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Colters_Hell.jpg/500px-Colters_Hell.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Colters_Hell.jpg/1280px-Colters_Hell.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"